; BOUNDED AUTOMATIC TARGETING SYSTEMS, the Naga's rank-III weapon mod (SP4 Task 2). SP 2, LIMITED 2
; (charges_max; kit.gd draws the tag from it). Thermal Charge's shape: one PassiveWeaponMod carrying
; one on-hit effect. Fits MELEE (2), RIFLE (3), NEXUS (5); AUX (0), MAIN (1), HEAVY (2) - never
; SUPERHEAVY. The card's Effect paragraph is the gear.<id>.effect row. SP5: a closed bounded frame
; with a fixed targeting dot - no action of its own, so this is the mod's only surface.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_weaponmod"]
script = ExtResource("3_weaponmod")
allowed_sizes = Array[int]([0, 1, 2])
allowed_types = Array[int]([2, 3, 5])
on_hit_effects = Array[ExtResource("4_onhiteffect")]([ExtResource("5_onhit")])

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_kit")
passives = Array[ExtResource("2_passive")]([SubResource("Resource_weaponmod")])
sp_cost = 2
charges_max = 2
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://ckrv6mvs5q65e"
icon_override = ExtResource("6_icon")
